index.description:
High-quality 3D model with highly detailed interior.
The model is suitable for high quality visualization.
The model can be used in games.

Name: 
Type: model
Format: 3Ds Max 2021
Export: FBX OBJ MAT
Render: Corona (10)
Polys: 
XForm: Yes
Matclasses: CoronaPhisiclMtl
Units: centimeters

Why choose our models?
+ Everything is ready for rendering. Just press the render button and you will get a preview picture!
+ Does not require additional plugins;
+ Textures are included;
+ Suitable for large-scale visualization;
+ All objects are reasonably divided and named;
+ All materials are correctly named;
+ You can easily change or apply new materials, colors, etc;
+ The model has a good topology;
+ Suitable for animation and high quality photorealistic visualization
